---
import Layout from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Datonic"
  description="Datonic helps communities collaborate on open tabular data by building on, coalescing, and bridging existing tools and standards."
>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p class="lede">
    Datonic aims to be the best place for communities to collaborate on tabular
    data. It is not a new standard. It aims to build upon, coalesce, and make
    bridges.
  </p>

  <p>
    The goal is to bring <a href="https://davidgasquez.com/handbook/open-data"
      >Open Data to the level of Open Source</a
    > by making Open Data integrate with the modern data ecosystem.
  </p>

  <p>
    Let's move towards a world that produces open data with open source software
    using open protocols running on open and public infrastructure.
  </p>

  <hr />

  <h2>Ideals</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>Community focus</li>
    <li>Modularity</li>
    <li>Permissionless ecosystem</li>
    <li>Declarative tooling</li>
    <li>Immutability</li>
    <li>Serverless approach</li>
    <li>Pragmatic decentralization</li>
    <li>Reproducible and accessible</li>
    <li>Optimized for humans</li>
  </ul>
</Layout>
